ted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/extras/d53c50fdf94f8f8fcb60edb482f3e218.poster.avif?t=1735347943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/extras/d53c50fdf94f8f8fcb60edb482f3e218.webm?t=1735347943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/extras/d53c50fdf94f8f8fcb60edb482f3e218.mp4?t=1735347943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish play is rewarded with level ups that improve speed and damage. Creative moment to moment strategy is essential to survival.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>!?!?!?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/extras/8966b90b387431b43c03e1841a5316a7.poster.avif?t=1735347943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/extras/8966b90b387431b43c03e1841a5316a7.webm?t=1735347943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/extras/8966b90b387431b43c03e1841a5316a7.mp4?t=1735347943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the core of a mysterious and surreal post-apocalyptic world. What's at the bottom and beyond? Only through violence may answers be found.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Jake Stevenson"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332660/header.jpg?t=1735347943","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332660/799389/a2b7667a4462